<TABLE cellSpacing="0" cellPadding="4" border="0">
  
      <TR valign="top">
        <td style="white-space: nowrap" align="center">
          <span style="font-size: large">
              The March Goes On
          </span><br>
          <span style="font-size:xx-small">
            11/30/2004 4:35:16 PM
            <br>
            <a href="/member.aspx?userid=3">
            Jarrington Avendaar
            </a></span>
          <br>
          <br>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <TR valign="top">
        <td>
          <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <p style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">In spite of the new games making their way to the shelves in November, raiding continues on at The Company.&nbsp; We mourn the passing of those who've gone on to glory in other worlds, and welcome to the fold those new recruits who've proved their mettle and joined our ranks.<br /><br />It is with an especially heavy heart that we bid fond farewell to Domique Talonfist, who's steadfast leadership has seen the guild through trial and trouble.&nbsp; In recent months Domique has re-discovered the real world and leaves us not for another digital one.&nbsp; Your presence my friend will be sorely missed amongst our ranks.&nbsp; We wish you the best of luck in life, and we will always leave the light on for you.<br /><br />Here's a small sample of some recent loot awards both raid and otherwise:</p></blockquote> <ul dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <li dir="ltr"> <div style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=30761" target="_new">Aged Hoop of Battle</a>&nbsp;- Yirrudno</div> <li dir="ltr"> <div style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=32564" target="_new">Ring of Hollow Faith</a>&nbsp;- Buktuan</div> <li dir="ltr"> <div style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=32184" target="_new">Shadowed Ring of Feathers</a>&nbsp;- Jarrington</div> <li dir="ltr"> <div style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=32662" target="_new">Glimmering Veil of Piety</a>&nbsp;- Multiple players</div> <li dir="ltr"> <div style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><a target="_new" href="http://lucy.allakhazam.com/item.html?id=70602">Facade of Fright</a>&nbsp;- Multiple players</div> <li dir="ltr"> <div style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><a target="_new" href="http://lucy.allakhazam.com/item.html?id=70601">Supple Crimson Choker</a>&nbsp;- Multiple players<br /></div></li></ul> <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <p style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">Congratulations Cynwydd on completing your 1.5 epic!<br /><br />Jarrington Avendaar<br />Webmaster, Officer<br />The Company<br /></p></blockquote>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <tr><td><hr size=1></td></tr>
    
      <TR valign="top">
        <td style="white-space: nowrap" align="center">
          <span style="font-size: large">
              Shades & Memories
          </span><br>
          <span style="font-size:xx-small">
            11/11/2004 7:23:30 PM
            <br>
            <a href="/member.aspx?userid=3">
            Jarrington Avendaar
            </a></span>
          <br>
          <br>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <TR valign="top">
        <td>
          <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><img style="FLOAT: right; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none" alt="Smith Rondo" src="http://company.bertoxx.com/pics/smithrondo.jpg" /> <p><a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=15476" target="_new">Smith Rondo</a> <br /><a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=15620" target="_new">Suled Dar's Shade</a> <br /><br />The Company, having been quite busy recently in acquiring new epics, briefly turned its attention to Veeshan's Peak.&nbsp; We also took some time out to turn Smith Rondo into a memory for the 3rd time.</p></blockquote> <ul> <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=26140" target="_new">Veil of Forgotten Heroes</a>&nbsp;- Samie <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=26281" target="_new">Muramite Plated Bracer</a>&nbsp;- Iaedyine</li></ul> <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"><br /><br /> <p>Congratulations to the following folks for completing their 1.5 epics!</p><img style="FLOAT: right; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none" alt="Suled Dar's Shade" src="http://company.bertoxx.com/pics/suleddar.jpg" /> </blockquote> <ul> <li>Blyndem - Enchanter <li>Danyela - Enchanter <li>Mordrid - Necromancer <li>Morttisha - Necromancer <li>Danzignuk - Shadow Knight <li>Aynar&nbsp;- Shaman <li>Kalanar - Shaman <li>Crizpin - Warrior</li></ul> <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">Jarrington Avendaar<br />Officer, Webmaster<br />The Company<br /></blockquote>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <tr><td><hr size=1></td></tr>
    
      <TR valign="top">
        <td style="white-space: nowrap" align="center">
          <span style="font-size: large">
              Death to Chicken Feet!
          </span><br>
          <span style="font-size:xx-small">
            8/11/2004 6:40:58 AM
            <br>
            <a href="/member.aspx?userid=284">
            Valandil Telperion
            </a></span>
          <br>
          <br>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <TR valign="top">
        <td>
          <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <p><img style="FLOAT: right; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none" alt="Fennin Down!" src="/pics/fennin.jpg" /><a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=10778" target="_new">Fennin Ro - The Tyrant of Fire</a><br /><br /><i>"Fennin Ro is the being who rules the greater elemental Plane of Fire, from which he derives his title, the Tyrant of Fire. Fennin manifests himself as a large male humanoid with barbaric features including a beard of flame, glowing red eyes, pointed ears, and fangs. Although he has been known to be a fanatic in terms of preserving the element of fire, displaying a short temper toward that preservation and any who would dare to threaten it, Fennin Ro retains a strong influence on the wheel of Order and Discord."</i> <br /><br />The Company moved forcefully into the bastion of the great fire tyrant, Fennin Ro and slew him. For the record: 41 people - second ever attempt - flawless kill. Congratulations and great work folks. <br /><br /></p></blockquote> <ul> <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=18100" target="_new">Earring of Eternal Flame</a> - Sabourque <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=18101" target="_new">Immaculate Vest of the Fire Tyrant</a> - Zalern <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=19956" target="_new">Flame Idol of Ro</a> - Novavoyer <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=20743" target="_new">Globe of Dancing Flame</a> - Valandil (Woohoo)</li></ul> <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <p>Valandil Telperion<br />Officer, The Company<br /></p></blockquote>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <tr><td><hr size=1></td></tr>
    
      <TR valign="top">
        <td style="white-space: nowrap" align="center">
          <span style="font-size: large">
              Entry into Vex Thal - rifts all around!
          </span><br>
          <span style="font-size:xx-small">
            6/3/2004 8:22:03 PM
            <br>
            <a href="/member.aspx?userid=284">
            Valandil Telperion
            </a></span>
          <br>
          <br>
        </td>
      </TR>
      <TR valign="top">
        <td>
          <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <p><img style="FLOAT: right; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none" alt="Emperor" src="http://company2.bertoxx.com/pics/emp.jpg" /> <a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=7898" target="_new">Emperor Ssraeshza</a><br /><br />For the first time The Company killed Emperor Ssraeshza and gained entry into <a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?zone=146" target="_new">Vex Thal</a>. 38 people and 15 mins later he dropped some loot: </p></blockquote> <ul> <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12392" target="_new">Envenomed Moccasins </a>- Hida <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=13237" target="_new">Acrylia Handled Broadsword</a> - Juda <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16300" target="_new">Torque of the Wyrmlord</a> - Danzignuk <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12446" target="_new">Ssraeshzaen Honor Guard Bracer</a> - Debu <li><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=11878" target="_new">Imperial Symbol of the Shissar</a> - Buktuan</ul> <blockquote dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px"> <p>Valandil Telperion<br />Officer, The Company<br /></p></blockquote>
